# Copy this file to .github/CODEOWNERS after the new GitHub repository exists.
# Replace every <...> value with a GitHub user or visible GitHub organization
# team that has explicit write access to the repository. Do not enable
# "Require review from Code Owners" until every placeholder is replaced.

*                                           @<org-or-user>/platform-maintainers

/apps/control-api/                          @<org-or-user>/control-plane-owners
/apps/agent-runtime/                        @<org-or-user>/runtime-owners
/apps/jobs-worker/                          @<org-or-user>/runtime-owners
/libs/python/                               @<org-or-user>/runtime-owners
/apps/studio-web/                           @<org-or-user>/studio-owners
/packages/                                  @<org-or-user>/studio-owners

/contracts/                                 @<org-or-user>/contract-db-owners
/database/migrations/                       @<org-or-user>/contract-db-owners
/infra/                                     @<org-or-user>/platform-maintainers
/.github/                                   @<org-or-user>/platform-maintainers
/AGENTS.md                                  @<org-or-user>/platform-maintainers
/AGENT_CODING_RULES.md                       @<org-or-user>/platform-maintainers
/ARCHITECTURE.md                             @<org-or-user>/platform-maintainers
/CONTRIBUTING.md                             @<org-or-user>/platform-maintainers
/scripts/                                   @<org-or-user>/platform-maintainers
